{
  "bookId": "rewind-40",
  "id": "chapter-161",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|102|＝按玩家性别变化的称谓。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "35515001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "呵呵，不逃了吗？从谁先开始呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狂霸虎",
          "text": "该死，我们几人联手都打不过这个女人！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "哎，要是实在打不过的话，就加入吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "熊傲天",
          "text": "啊？这、这样好吗，那不然……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿斩仙",
          "text": "用点脑子！你看不出来她根本不想放任何人走吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "很遗憾，各位的音容笑貌，我会铭记在心的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "呵呵，铭记在心？放心，我会温柔地打开你的胸膛——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿斩仙",
          "text": "趁她吸引了那女人的注意，咱们快逃！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狂霸虎",
          "text": "多谢你出口相救，走！您就是我们的救命恩人！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "真吵……你们还是都永远保持安静比较好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "那你呢？是把微笑这个表情焊死在脸上了吗，棺材脸？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "嗯？就从你开始吧，小猫咪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515013",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "滋滋滋——恐怖的电锯声再次响起。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515014",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "追踪者三十号！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515015",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "嘭——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "喵！谁扔的炸弹？咳咳咳，呛死猫了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "嘿嘿，真是太——刺激了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "哈莉，你怎么来了？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "哎？一只猫把我叼过来的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "勇气可佳，居然敢挡在我的面前，是想一起被锯开吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "小红小蓝，战斗准备！我不会让你伤害米菲亚的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "哈莉……你……说什么呢！猫才不需要手办来救！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "呵呵，看来你身后的小姑娘不是这么想的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515024",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "滋滋——滋滋滋——滋滋滋滋！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "小心她的电锯！说了不用你救！跑啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515026",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "滋滋滋滋——滋滋——滋——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "挡在伙伴面前，这是梅根队长教给我的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "很不错，哈莉，看来梅根把你教得很好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35515029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "塞西尔长官？！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-837",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "2023mifia",
          "rowIds": [
